  "description": "There are two non-heritage style rooflights currently in place on the inner facing slopes of an M-shaped roof (not visible from the street). These have failed and are now leaking. \n\nThe proposal calls for the replacement of the two damaged rooflights with new rooflights from the Velux Heritage Conservation range. The proposed rooflights have a slim elegant profile, a vertical glazing bar, and an increased thermal performance. There will be a like for like replacement, so far as possible, to fit the existing rooflight dimensions.\n\nThe Velux model to be used is GGL-H.",
